WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.840
This is your city.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.020
Every chapter has its own home.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:08.120
The Daily Pulse is a short briefing every morning with the news that matters.

00:00:08.539 --> 00:00:11.440
The boards are where people post jobs, things for sale,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.920
fosters and rescues.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.420
You will find what is happening this week,

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.340
and the places members vote to the top.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.080
We want to hear from you.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.420
As a member, you shape your city:

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.120
comment on the Pulse, post on the boards,

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.940
send us a hot tip, let us know if something needs to be fixed,

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.660
and vote for your chapter.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.480
Do not see your city yet?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.660
Vote for where we should go next.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.620
Membership is free.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.860
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.240
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:47.360
And the best way to bring your city to life is to bring people in:

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.820
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans,

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.840
so they can use these tools with you.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.540
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.580
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.160
community.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.439
Find your city, and say hello.

